                "title": "Crystal Egg Knob with Carre Rose",
                "description": "The Crystal Egg Knob with Carre Rose has a beautiful design that is perfect for traditional homes. This Egg Provence Knob with Carre Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors. It can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Carre Short Plate with Provence Crystal Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
